It doesnt matter what I pass to the set..

calling EVP_MD_fetch(NULL, "SHA256", NULL); anywhere populates the namemap otherwise it doesnt.

The name returned from the ecdh_exch is "SHA2-256" for both cases

fix_cipher_md() calls get_algo_by_name() which calls get_md_by_name() which calls evp_get_digestbyname_ex() has the following code...

````
    dp = (const EVP_MD *)OBJ_NAME_get(name, OBJ_NAME_TYPE_MD_METH);

    if (dp != NULL)
        return dp;

    namemap = ossl_namemap_stored(libctx);
    id = ossl_namemap_name2num(namemap, name);
    if (id == 0)
        return NULL;
````

dp is NULL since there is no alias for "SHA2-256"
And without the call to EVP_MD_fetch() id returns 0.

